{"id":"8a33e48ac2e02687","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-nonhigh-schnorr-ml.md","title":"非高程度上 Schnorr 与 ML 随机性一致","display":"thm-nonhigh-schnorr-ml — 非高程度上 Schnorr 与 ML 随机性一致","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-nonhigh-schnorr-ml","aliases":["43-thm-nonhigh-schnorr-ml"],"display":"thm-nonhigh-schnorr-ml — 非高程度上 Schnorr 与 ML 随机性一致","depends_on":["[[43-df-schnorrrandom]]","[[43-df-mlrandom]]","[[43-df-jump]]","[[43-df-turing-red]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§10.4.2 Theorem 10.4.9，印刷222，PDF242","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-nonhigh-schnorr-ml"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-nonhigh-schnorr-ml</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-nonhigh-schnorr-ml — 非高程度上 Schnorr 与 ML 随机性一致"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c8d43a74ea8721f3\" href=\"?note=c8d43a74ea8721f3\" title=\"43-df-schnorrrandom\">43-df-schnorrrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§10.4.2 Theorem 10.4.9，印刷222，PDF242"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；随机性、跳跃及归约见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c8d43a74ea8721f3\" href=\"?note=c8d43a74ea8721f3\" title=\"43-df-schnorrrandom\">43-df-schnorrrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLRandom}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"c8d43a74ea8721f3\" href=\"?note=c8d43a74ea8721f3\" title=\"43-df-schnorrrandom\">43-df-schnorrrandom</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}(X)\\land\\varnothing\\prime\\prime\\nleq_TX\\prime\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}(X)\\land\\varnothing\\prime\\prime\\nleq_TX\\prime\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若X失败ML检验，进入各层的阶段是X可计算函数。非高性给可计算函数无穷多次超过这些阶段，将失败转成总Solovay失败。</p>\n<p>来源：§10.4.2 Theorem 10.4.9，印刷222，PDF242。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-schnorrrandom","status":"resolved","id":"c8d43a74ea8721f3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-schnorrrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mlrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"b3936ae4c5d2dc79","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-schnorrrandom","status":"resolved","id":"c8d43a74ea8721f3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；随机性、跳跃及归约见 [[43-df-schnorrrandom]]、[[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-jump]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；随机性、跳跃及归约见 [[43-df-schnorrrandom]]、[[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-jump]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"b3936ae4c5d2dc79","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；随机性、跳跃及归约见 [[43-df-schnorrrandom]]、[[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-jump]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；随机性、跳跃及归约见 [[43-df-schnorrrandom]]、[[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-jump]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$ 是 $2^\\omega$ 上的布尔谓词，见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]。\n$\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}$ 是 $2^\\omega$ 上的布尔谓词，见 [[43-df-schnorrrandom]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-schnorrrandom","status":"resolved","id":"c8d43a74ea8721f3","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$ 是 $2^\\omega$ 上的布尔谓词，见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]。\n$\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}$ 是 $2^\\omega$ 上的布尔谓词，见 [[43-df-schnorrrandom]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MLRandom}","display":false},{"tex":"2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}","display":false},{"tex":"2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}(X)\\land\\varnothing\\prime\\prime\\nleq_TX\\prime\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X).","display":true}],"bytes":1420,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-224","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-nonhigh-schnorr-ml]] — 非高程度上 Schnorr 与 ML 随机性一致"}],"outgoing":["c8d43a74ea8721f3","0586e0fd0301d605","b3936ae4c5d2dc79","0784d1de3a88cd94"]}